# ── Repo-root hygiene boundary (AGENTS.md: one-off artifact convention) ──
# All one-off debug scripts and run artifacts live in .scratch/ and never in the root.
/.scratch/

# ── Runtime artifact store workspace (SPEC P0-4: content-addressed artifacts
